   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UAEM Innovation Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The biomedical research system is failing to address global need-8/10universities in the U.S. and Canada spend less than 2% of their research dollars on treatments and prevention for neglected diseases, which affect nearly 2 billion people around the world.   Universities Allied for Essential Medicines (UAEM) is launching an innovation fund to help us train new researchers to tackle these diseases and increase the open-access publication of biomedical research.</narrative>
  </description>
